    "description": "Welcome to 1251-1253 48th Ave, a coveted vacant duplex in the Outer Sunset.  First time on market in nearly 50 years.  The upper flat #1253, a 3 bed/1 bath configuration, was recently updated with wood floors, recessed lighting, and a modern open floorplan.  Kitchen is equipped with stainless steel appliances, quartz countertops and shaker cabinets.  A skylight provides brilliant all-day natural light. The lower flat #1251, a 3 bed 2 bath configuration, has an exclusive-use covered patio and convenient ground floor entrance.  Shared laundry room. Tesla EV charger in garage. 1 car parking in garage with additional off-street parking in front of garage. In 2020, added new Roof and 15-panel solar array, which is seller-owned and serves both units. The large west-facing backyard provides front row seats to enjoy stunning sunsets, and moments of solitude, or lively conversations with loved ones.   Stop into one of the excellent local eateries: Hookfish, Palm City, Outerlands, and Java Beach.  Close to Ocean Beach and Golden Gate Park for unlimited beach and outdoor recreation. A paradise for surfers, runners, and cyclists.  Convenient commute location via Great Highway, Sunset Blvd, & Muni Metro.  Versatile property for family compound, TIC/condo conversion, rental & more."
  },
